2
00:06:37,308 --> 00:06:39,108
ホロライブに入る！！
[Note: Join hololive!!]

3
00:06:43,308 --> 00:06:46,308
オーディション会場
[Sign: Audition Venue]

4
00:07:42,808 --> 00:07:45,508
群青
[Song: Gunjou]

5
00:07:45,508 --> 00:07:47,708
嗚呼、いつものように
Ah, as usual,

6
00:07:47,708 --> 00:07:51,908
過ぎる日々に あくびが出る
I yawn at the passing days.

7
00:07:51,908 --> 00:07:55,808
さんざめく夜、越え、今日も
Moving past a bustling night, today again

8
00:07:55,808 --> 00:07:59,508
渋谷の街に朝が降る
morning descends upon the streets of Shibuya.

9
00:07:59,508 --> 00:08:01,908
どこか虚しいような
Feeling somewhat empty,

10
00:08:01,908 --> 00:08:03,608
そんな気持ち
such a feeling

11
00:08:03,608 --> 00:08:05,508
つまらないな
is so boring.

12
00:08:05,508 --> 00:08:07,408
でもそれでいい
But that's fine,

13
00:08:07,408 --> 00:08:09,208
そんなもんさ
that's just how it is.

14
00:08:09,208 --> 00:08:10,908
これでいい
This is fine.

15
00:08:10,908 --> 00:08:14,008
知らず知らず隠してた
Without realizing it, I hid it away;

16
00:08:14,008 --> 00:08:17,508
本当の声を響かせてよ、ほら
let your true voice ring out, come on.

17
00:08:17,508 --> 00:08:20,208
見ないフリしていても
Even if you pretend not to see it,

18
00:08:20,208 --> 00:08:23,708
確かにそこにある
it is definitely right there.

19
00:08:23,708 --> 00:08:27,808
あぁ 感じたままに描く
Ah, painting just as I feel,

20
00:08:27,808 --> 00:08:31,108
自分で選んだその色で
with the colors I chose myself.

21
00:08:31,108 --> 00:08:34,508
眠い空気纏う朝に
In the morning draped in drowsy air,

22
00:08:34,508 --> 00:08:38,608
訪れた青い世界
a blue world arrived before me.

23
00:08:38,608 --> 00:08:42,008
好きなものを好きだと言う
Saying I love the things I love—

24
00:08:42,008 --> 00:08:45,308
怖くて仕方ないけど
I was terribly scared, but

25
00:08:45,308 --> 00:08:47,508
本当の自分
my true self,

26
00:08:47,508 --> 00:08:50,308
出会えた気がしたんだ
I felt like I had finally met her.

27
00:09:00,508 --> 00:09:04,308
嗚呼、手を伸ばせば伸ばすほどに
Ah, the further I stretch out my hands,

28
00:09:04,308 --> 00:09:06,908
遠くへゆく
the farther away it goes.

29
00:09:06,908 --> 00:09:10,308
思うようにいかない、今日も
Things don't go as planned; today, too,

30
00:09:10,308 --> 00:09:14,108
また慌ただしくもがいてる
I'm hectically struggling once again.

31
00:09:14,108 --> 00:09:16,308
悔しい気持ちも
Even feelings of frustration

32
00:09:16,308 --> 00:09:18,508
ただ情けなくて
and feeling pathetic

33
00:09:18,508 --> 00:09:20,708
涙が出る
make tears fall.

34
00:09:20,708 --> 00:09:22,708
踏み込むほど
The further I step in,

35
00:09:22,708 --> 00:09:24,608
苦しくなる
the more painful it gets,

36
00:09:24,608 --> 00:09:27,108
痛くもなる
and it hurts, too.

37
00:09:27,808 --> 00:09:32,108
あぁ 感じたままに進む
Ah, moving forward just as I feel,

38
00:09:32,108 --> 00:09:35,308
自分で選んだこの道を
along this path I chose myself.

39
00:09:35,308 --> 00:09:38,708
重いまぶた擦る夜に
On a night rubbing my heavy eyelids,

40
00:09:38,708 --> 00:09:42,808
しがみついた青い誓い
I clung to a blue vow.

41
00:09:42,808 --> 00:09:46,108
好きなことを続けること
Continuing to do what you love—

42
00:09:46,108 --> 00:09:49,608
それは「楽しい」だけじゃない
that isn't just about "having fun."

43
00:09:49,608 --> 00:09:51,708
本当にできる？
Can I really do it?

44
00:09:51,708 --> 00:09:53,608
不安になるけど
I get anxious, but

45
00:09:53,608 --> 00:09:55,308
あぁ 何枚でも
Ah, no matter how many canvases,

46
00:09:55,308 --> 00:09:57,008
ほら何枚でも
look, no matter how many sheets,

47
00:09:57,008 --> 00:10:00,608
自信がないから描いてきたんだよ
it's because I lacked confidence that I kept drawing!

48
00:10:00,608 --> 00:10:02,308
あぁ 何回でも ほら
Ah, no matter how many times, look—

49
00:10:02,395 --> 00:10:07,195
ああ 何回でも積み上げてきたことが武器になる
Ah, everything I've built up time and again will become my weapon.

50
00:10:07,495 --> 00:10:10,695
周りを見たって 誰と比べたって
Even if I look around, even if I compare myself to others,

51
00:10:10,695 --> 00:10:14,595
僕にしかできないことはなんだ
what is something that only I can do?

52
00:10:14,795 --> 00:10:19,995
今だって 自信なんかない それでも
Even now, I have no confidence at all, but still...

53
00:10:20,395 --> 00:10:25,595
感じたことない気持ち 知らずにいた想い
Emotions I've never felt before, feelings I never knew I had...

54
00:10:25,895 --> 00:10:28,895
あの日 踏み出して
Taking that step forward on that day,

55
00:10:28,895 --> 00:10:32,895
初めて感じたこの痛みも全部
even all this pain I felt for the first time...

56
00:10:33,295 --> 00:10:37,195
好きなものと向き合うことで
By facing what I love head-on,

57
00:10:37,195 --> 00:10:40,595
触れた まだ小さな光
I touched a faint, tiny light.

58
00:10:40,595 --> 00:10:44,895
大丈夫 行こう あとは楽しむだけだ
It's alright, let's go. All that's left is to enjoy it!

59
00:10:47,695 --> 00:10:51,395
ああ 全てを賭けて描く
Ah, I'll risk everything and paint

60
00:10:51,395 --> 00:10:55,195
自分にしか出せない色で
in colors that only I can create.

61
00:10:55,195 --> 00:10:58,895
朝も夜も走り続け
Running relentlessly day and night,

62
00:10:58,895 --> 00:11:02,395
見つけ出した青い光
I found that blue light.

63
00:11:02,395 --> 00:11:05,895
好きなものと向き合うこと
Facing what I love head-on

64
00:11:05,895 --> 00:11:09,395
今だって怖いことだけど
is still terrifying even now, but

65
00:11:09,395 --> 00:11:15,195
もう今は あの日 透明な僕じゃない
I am no longer the transparent me of that day.

66
00:11:15,395 --> 00:11:17,895
ああ ありのままの
Ah, staying true to who I am,

67
00:11:17,895 --> 00:11:20,795
かけがえのない僕だ
I am irreplaceable.

68
00:11:20,895 --> 00:11:24,395
知らず知らず隠してた
Without realizing it, I hid it away,

69
00:11:24,395 --> 00:11:27,595
本当の声を響かせてよ ほら
so let your true voice ring out, look!

70
00:11:27,595 --> 00:11:30,395
見ないフリしていても
Even if you pretend not to see it,

71
00:11:30,395 --> 00:11:34,795
確かにそこに 今もそこにあるよ
it's definitely right there, still there even now.

72
00:11:34,995 --> 00:11:38,395
知らず知らず隠してた
Without realizing it, I hid it away,

73
00:11:38,395 --> 00:11:41,595
本当の声を響かせてよ さあ
so let your true voice ring out, come on!

74
00:11:41,595 --> 00:11:44,395
見ないフリしていても
Even if you pretend not to see it,

75
00:11:44,395 --> 00:11:48,895
確かにそこに 君のなかに
it's definitely right there, inside of you.

76
00:12:03,195 --> 00:12:06,595
Ah ah ah ah ah ah Hey

77
00:12:06,795 --> 00:12:09,895
Ah ah ah ah ah ah

78
00:12:10,195 --> 00:12:13,395
Ah ah ah ah ah ah Hey

79
00:12:13,595 --> 00:12:16,595
Ah ah ah ah ah ah

80
00:12:16,795 --> 00:12:19,895
奪って奪って
Snatch it away, snatch it away,

81
00:12:19,895 --> 00:12:23,395
脳みその中から「やめろ馬鹿」と喚くモラリティ
morality screams "stop, you idiot!" from inside my brain.

82
00:12:23,695 --> 00:12:26,695
Darling Baby Darling

83
00:12:26,695 --> 00:12:30,195
半端無く狂うと煌めき浮き足立つフィロソフィー
when it goes insanely wild, philosophy sparkles and gets restless.

84
00:12:30,395 --> 00:12:32,395
死ぬほど可愛い？ 上目遣い
Deadly cute? Upturned eyes,

85
00:12:32,395 --> 00:12:35,595
何かしらに触れるくらい ばら撒く乱視
scattering astigmatism enough to touch just about anything.

86
00:12:35,595 --> 00:12:37,695
気付けば当時 この世に生まれた君が悪い
Before I knew it, you're the one to blame for being born into this world.

87
00:12:37,795 --> 00:12:39,795
やたらとしんどい 恋患い
Exceedingly exhausting lovesickness,

88
00:12:39,795 --> 00:12:42,195
バラバラな頭とこの身体
this shattered head and broken body.

89
00:12:42,195 --> 00:12:45,195
頸動脈からアイラブユーを吐き出して アイ...
Spitting out "I love you" from my carotid artery, I...

90
00:12:45,395 --> 00:12:48,795
一体どうしよう この想いをどうしよう
What on earth should I do? What do I do with these feelings?

91
00:12:48,795 --> 00:12:52,395
肋骨の奥のザラメが溶けてケロイドになりそう
The brown sugar deep in my ribs is melting, about to become a keloid.

92
00:12:52,395 --> 00:12:55,995
怒号 罵詈雑言 愚劣にそう
Roars of rage, abusive language, foolishly so,

93
00:12:55,995 --> 00:12:59,395
今この世で君だけ大正解
right now in this world, you alone are the absolute correct answer.

94
00:12:59,395 --> 00:13:06,895
Darling Darling Darling Darling Darling Darling Darling Darling

95
00:13:13,395 --> 00:13:16,895
ひっくり返っても勝ち目はない 君だけルールは適用外
Even turning things upside down, there's no chance of winning; you alone are exempt from the rules.

96
00:13:16,895 --> 00:13:20,195
寄る辺も白黒しかない 風邪引く夜
Even my refuge is strictly black and white on this chilly night.

97
00:13:20,195 --> 00:13:24,395
君が笑顔で放ったアバダケダブラで タブラ・ラサ
With the Avada Kedavra fired from your smile, tabula rasa,

98
00:13:24,395 --> 00:13:26,395
泥水飲み干すにも申し訳ねえな
it feels almost rude to drink up muddy water.

99
00:13:26,395 --> 00:13:27,895
容赦して 貫いて 「ここ弱点」
Have mercy, pierce through, "here's the weak spot."

100
00:13:27,895 --> 00:13:29,895
死ぬほど可愛い？ 上目遣い
Deadly cute? Upturned eyes,

101
00:13:29,895 --> 00:13:33,195
何かしらに触れるくらい ばら撒く乱視
scattering astigmatism enough to touch just about anything.

102
00:13:33,195 --> 00:13:35,195
気付けば当時 この世に生まれた君が悪い
Before I knew it, you're the one to blame for being born into this world.

103
00:13:35,195 --> 00:13:38,795
パチモンでもいい なんでもいい 今君となぞってる全て欲しい
Even a knockoff is fine, anything is fine, I want everything I'm tracing with you right now.

104
00:13:38,795 --> 00:13:42,895
頸動脈からアイラブユーを吐き出して アイリスアウト
Spitting out "I love you" from my carotid artery, iris out!

105
00:13:47,195 --> 00:13:50,395
Ah ah ah ah アイリスアウト
Ah ah ah ah, iris out!

106
00:13:53,895 --> 00:13:56,395
Ah ah ah ah アイリスアウト
Ah ah ah ah, iris out!

107
00:13:56,395 --> 00:13:59,895
一体どうしよう この想いをどうしよう
What on earth should I do? What do I do with these feelings?

108
00:13:59,895 --> 00:14:03,395
肋骨の奥のザラメが溶けてケロイドになりそう
The brown sugar deep in my ribs is melting, about to become a keloid.

109
00:14:03,395 --> 00:14:06,995
怒号 罵詈雑言 愚劣にそう
Roars of rage, abusive language, foolishly so,

110
00:14:06,995 --> 00:14:10,895
今この世で君だけ大正解
right now in this world, you alone are the absolute correct answer.

111
00:14:10,895 --> 00:14:17,895
Darling Darling Darling Darling Darling Darling Darling Darling

112
00:14:21,195 --> 00:14:24,895
La ah ah...

113
00:14:36,195 --> 00:14:38,895
しゅぴしゅわ〜！ スーの充電足りてる〜？
Shupishuwa~! Are you fully charged with Suu energy?

114
00:14:39,195 --> 00:14:43,195
ホロライブDEV_IS、FLOW GLOWの、いろいろ担当、水宮すうでーす！
From hololive DEV_IS's FLOW GLOW, in charge of variety, I'm Suzu Minase!

115
00:14:43,395 --> 00:14:49,395
ということで、STEP INTO DREAMS始まりましたー！ イエーイ！
And with that, "STEP INTO DREAMS" has begun! Yay!

116
00:14:51,195 --> 00:14:55,395
今回はですね、オープニングにもあった通り、
So for today, just like in the opening,

117
00:14:55,395 --> 00:15:00,045
夢だった、ホロライブに入って夢だった、初めてのソロ生...
it's been my dream ever since joining hololive, my very first solo live...

118
00:15:00,374 --> 00:15:03,874
生誕ライブー！それー、いぇーーい！
My Birthday Live! Here we go, yay!

119
00:15:04,374 --> 00:15:07,674
ちょっと めちゃめちゃに緊張しているんですけれども、
I'm super nervous right now, but...

120
00:15:07,674 --> 00:15:09,874
どうだった？Gunjo with Iris Out
How was "Gunjo with Iris Out"?

121
00:15:09,874 --> 00:15:13,074
コメント欄どうだった？かっこよかった？
How was it in the comments? Was it cool?

122
00:15:13,374 --> 00:15:16,374
かっこよかったってきっと、まあこの後流れるんだろうな。
I'm sure comments saying "it was cool" will start flowing soon.

123
00:15:16,374 --> 00:15:18,874
かっこよかっただろう！
I bet it was cool, right!

124
00:15:18,874 --> 00:15:20,874
いっぱい褒めてください！
Please shower me with compliments!

125
00:15:20,874 --> 00:15:23,374
今回はですね、タイトルにもある通り、
This time, just as the title says,

126
00:15:23,374 --> 00:15:27,874
もうステップが、もうはちゃめちゃに、もうステップが、ステップがもうはちゃめちゃに多かったりですね、
there were crazy amounts of steps in the dance routines,

127
00:15:27,874 --> 00:15:34,174
あとは、やったことのないジャンルのダンスにも挑戦しちゃったりしていますので、
and I'm also challenging dance genres I've never tried before,

128
00:15:34,174 --> 00:15:36,874
お楽しみにー！
so please look forward to it!

129
00:15:36,874 --> 00:15:43,874
ハッシュタグは、こちらにある #水宮すう生誕祭2026 です！
The hashtag is #MizumiyaSuBirthdayFestival2026 right up here!

130
00:15:44,374 --> 00:15:49,174
スクショとか、感想とかたーくさんポストしてくれると嬉しいです！
I'd be so happy if you post tons of screenshots and your thoughts!

131
00:15:49,374 --> 00:15:51,874
目指せ、トレンド！
Let's aim to trend!

132
00:15:51,874 --> 00:15:54,874
みんな、いっぱいポストしてねー！
Everyone, post lots and lots!

133
00:15:54,874 --> 00:15:58,874
この後はですね、ゲストパートにも行きたいと思っているの...
Next up, I was planning to move on to the guest part...

134
00:15:58,874 --> 00:16:00,374
ですが、
...however,

135
00:16:00,374 --> 00:16:05,874
なんと！お祝いの映像が届いてるみたいなので、見てみましょうー！
it seems a congratulatory video has arrived, so let's watch it!

136
00:16:05,874 --> 00:16:07,874
こっちかな？
Over this way?

137
00:16:07,874 --> 00:16:09,374
よし！
Alright!

138
00:16:10,374 --> 00:16:12,874
なんだなんだ？あっ！
What is it, what is it? Ah!

139
00:16:13,874 --> 00:16:20,874
君を笑顔へご案内！蘭楓の観光大使で、にじさんじ所属、綾柿のしっぽ、紫刈湖だよー！
Guiding you to smiles! Ranfu's tourism ambassador from NIJISANJI, Aya-kaki no Shippo, Shigariko here!

140
00:16:20,874 --> 00:16:22,174
リコー！
Riko-!

141
00:16:22,174 --> 00:16:25,174
水宮ー！お誕生日おめでとーー！
Mizumiya! Happy birthday!

142
00:16:25,174 --> 00:16:26,874
ありがとうーー！
Thank you!

143
00:16:26,874 --> 00:16:30,174
今頃は水宮は最高なライブをしていることでしょうー！
Right about now, Mizumiya must be putting on the best live show ever!

144
00:16:30,174 --> 00:16:31,374
そうかなー？
You think so~?

145
00:16:31,374 --> 00:16:32,874
本当におめでとー！
Huge congratulations!

146
00:16:32,874 --> 00:16:33,874
ありがとうー！
Thank you!

147
00:16:33,874 --> 00:16:37,374
本当はね、現地で直接お祝いがしたかったんですけど、
I really wanted to celebrate with you directly on stage, but...

148
00:16:37,374 --> 00:16:44,374
ちょっとどうしてもスケジュールが合わないということで、お祝いのメッセージ動画をね、今回送らせていただいております！
our schedules just didn't align, so I'm sending this video message to celebrate!

149
00:16:44,374 --> 00:16:48,374
水宮とはね、「どろめろ」としてもたくさんコラボして、
With Mizumiya, we've done so many collabs as "Doromero",

150
00:16:48,374 --> 00:16:50,574
プライベートとかでもテーマパーク行ったりとか、映画行ったりとか、
and in private we've gone to theme parks and movies together,

151
00:16:50,574 --> 00:16:52,874
行ったー！行ったー！
We did! We did!

152
00:16:52,874 --> 00:16:54,874
もう月イチでお泊まりするくらいの、
and we even have sleepovers like once a month...

153
00:16:54,874 --> 00:16:56,174
うん！
Yeah!

154
00:16:56,174 --> 00:16:58,874
仲良くね、させてもらってて、もう本当にいつもありがとー！
We're so close, so thank you so much as always!

155
00:16:58,874 --> 00:17:00,374
ありがとー！
